        <!--
            Signing key: EdDSA private key lives in the owner's login Keychain (account "claude-pet");
            its public key is SUPublicEDKey in ClaudePet/Info.plist. Back it up by running generate_keys
            with the account option set to claude-pet and -x claude-pet-private.key (keep that file secret).

            To publish a new release:
            1. Build, sign, notarize, staple the app
            2. Create zip: ditto -c -k -keepParent claude-pet.app claude-pet-vX.Y.zip
            3. Sign for Sparkle: run sign_update on the zip with the account option set to claude-pet
            4. Add a new <item> below with the edSignature and length
            5. Upload zip to GitHub Releases (github.com/freyzo/claude-pet)
            6. Commit appcast.xml and push to main (the app reads it from raw.githubusercontent.com)
        -->
